      "EpisodeMasterId": 130631,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你知道寄一个纸箱要多少钱吗？/n有钱寄东西不如留给家里用，我不是说过？",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1130",
      "BgmFileName": "202",
      "VoiceFileName": "1306310010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130631002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130631,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……促销活动国际运费免费？/n笨蛋，怎么可能。哥你真不会说谎。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1306310020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130631003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130631,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呵呵……好好，知道了，不是说谎对吧？/n就当免费吧。我现在拆，你等着——",
      "VoiceFileName": "1306310030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130631004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130631,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "——哦！这就是花椒味很足、很好吃的那个！/n这零食是哥你放的吧，你以前就喜欢。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1306310040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130631005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130631,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这个也好怀念！以前还会一起凑零花钱去买！/n……你说我从来不分你一半？都多少年前的事了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1306310050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130631006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130631,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯？这是什么？挺漂亮的小盒子啊？/n……又让我打开看看，哥你净说这个。",
      "VoiceFileName": "1306310060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 130631007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 130631,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
